OL,3,CBurnham vows to address 'ignored by
OL,4,CWestminster' in summer tour of UK
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham will look
OL,7,Fat issues "ignored by Westminster for
OL,8,Ftoo long" during the second week of
OL,9,Fhis summer tour of the UK.
OL,11,FThese issues include ending rough
OL,12,Fsleeping and resolving the "toxic
OL,13,Fdump, fly-tipping and environmental
OL,14,Fvandalism scandal".
OL,16,FMr Burnham will also be at Number 10
OL,17,FNorth during the week, marking a month
OL,18,Fsince it was established.
