OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786882712
OL,3,CBurnham vows to address 'ignored by
OL,4,CWestminster' in summer tour of UK
OL,6,FA Downing Street spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"The Prime Minister wants to bring
OL,8,Fback hope that we can finally fix the
OL,9,Fdifficult issues facing the country
OL,10,Fthat have been ignored by Westminster
OL,11,Ffor too long.
OL,13,F"This includes taking on issues that
OL,14,Fothers have said are intractable, like
OL,15,Fending rough sleeping and resolving
OL,16,Fthe toxic dump, fly-tipping and
OL,17,Fenvironmental vandalism scandal that
OL,18,Fis blighting communities across the UK.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
