OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786882712
OL,3,CBurnham vows to address 'ignored by
OL,4,CWestminster' in summer tour of UK
OL,6,F"The coming week will see the Prime
OL,7,FMinister take on some of these issues
OL,8,Fas he continues his tour around the
OL,9,FUK, which will inform his upcoming 10-
OL,10,Fyear plan to make Britain better off."
OL,12,FIn his first week of travelling around
OL,13,Fthe country, the Prime Minister
OL,14,Fvisited Derbyshire, the West Midlands,
OL,15,FDevon, and Cornwall to hear from local
OL,16,Fpeople and businesses.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
