OL,3,CBurnham vows to address 'ignored by
OL,4,CWestminster' in summer tour of UK
OL,6,FHe also announced a series of
OL,7,Fpolicies, including "easy to exit"
OL,8,Frules to help consumers cancel
OL,9,Fsubscriptions and a ban on retailers
OL,10,Fmaking misleading claims about
OL,11,Fdiscounts.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,18,FMr Burnham said he would also give
OL,19,Fcouncils new powers to block vape and
OL,20,Fbetting shops in a bid to save
OL,21,FBritain's "hollowed-out high streets".
OL,26,@oD@UOUoD@bO]}D@KOU}D@eO]
