OL,3,CBurnham vows to address 'ignored by
OL,4,CWestminster' in summer tour of UK
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister chaired a Cobra
OL,7,Fmeeting to discuss efforts to deal
OL,8,Fwith the extreme heat conditions
OL,9,Facross the UK, announced support for
OL,10,Ffarmers to help manage drought
OL,11,Fpressures, and visited families
OL,12,Faffected by wildfires in the West
OL,13,FMidlands.
OL,15,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,16,Four political experts are across all
OL,17,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,18,Fto the latest episode below...
